/// The trait every native thing carries. The compiler performs a builtin itself while binding;
/// what a builtin becomes in generated code is for the language layer of the target to say.
trait builtin: `Performed by the compiler at bind time, and native to the target in generated code` {
  where (`A trait body or a template needs the value of an operation of something carrying the trait at bind time`) -> `The binder evaluates the operation natively and uses the value`;
}
